<title>UK: Staveley Industries pretax profit declines.</title>
<headline>Staveley Industries pretax profit declines.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 29, 1997.</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		   9.8		 vs    16.4</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	    6.5		 vs     n/a</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)    9.0		 vs     9.0</p>
<p> Pretax			 16.6		 vs    23.2</p>
<p> Turnover		    399.8		 vs   372.9</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said its bagging systems division of Chronos Richardson had suffered a loss of five million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Staveley Industries.</p>
<p>---London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
